				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "# Catalyst Connect\n\nMessaging, coordination, and connection surfaces for Catalyst systems. Use it when the application needs clear channels between users, services, tools, or runtimes.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "bGPQBLDeS2q1g+8QwTQQtw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Is this what you are looking for?\n\nUse this component when its domain is part of the application, not just an implementation detail.\n\nIf the project only needs a quick one-off integration, this may not be the right layer yet. If the concept will become part of the product language, it probably is.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "DSwKav1+Tl+7hzVaFl2TUw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Documentation to add\n\n- Overview\n- Core model\n- Common workflows\n- Examples\n- Inspector views and tools\n- Configuration\n- Extension points\n\nKeep examples practical. A good component page should make someone want to try it immediately.\n"
			}
		]
